stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Running
    Running --> Stopped: idle at both checks
    Running --> Running: active use refuses
    Stopped --> Running: boot existing size
    Stopped --> Journaled: sync resize intent
    Journaled --> ProviderWritten: provider compare and swap
    ProviderWritten --> OwnerWritten: save matching owner
    OwnerWritten --> Resized: retire journal
    Resized --> Running: boot expanded size
    Journaled --> Journaled: crash and retry
    ProviderWritten --> ProviderWritten: crash and retry
    OwnerWritten --> OwnerWritten: crash and retry
